  "readme": "# Recipe Box\n\n![build](https://img.shields.io/badge/build-passing-green)\n\nRecipe Box saves recipes from any site and plans the week's meals. It's built with React and PostgreSQL.\n\n## Features\n\n- Import a recipe from a link\n- A weekly meal plan with a shopping list\n\n## Install\n\n```sh\nnpm install\nnpm run dev -- --port 5173\n```\n\n## Roadmap\n\n- Share meal plans with 5 friends\n- A mobile app\n\n## Acknowledgements\n\nThanks to @sam-example for the icons.\n",
